WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.075
Who decides?

2
00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:06.076
The policy owner decides enforcement, and
passes the enforce switch on the record,

3
00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:08.650
only after the report-only
result is clean.

4
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:12.686
The identity engineer runs the
policies and owns the partner list,

5
00:00:12.686 --> 00:00:14.887
reviewed with the partner register.

6
00:00:14.887 --> 00:00:19.117
The security monitor watches blocks
that weren't carried by the service:

7
00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:21.725
those are either an attack
or a broken client.

8
00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:24.589
For permissions: Policy
Read All for policies,

9
00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:27.904
named locations and the
tenant restrictions policy;

10
00:00:27.904 --> 00:00:32.200
Network Access Read All and Read
Write All for signaling and tagging;

11
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.118
and Policy Read Write Conditional
Access to create the policy,

12
00:00:36.118 --> 00:00:40.180
with the two administrator roles
activated just for the window.
